## Cost Estimation Summary

### Formulas Used

**Initial Replication:**
```
initial_transfer = replicable_TB × transfer_rate
initial_compute = replicable_TB × 1024 × 0.5 credits/GB × ${{ credit_rate }}
```

**Monthly Incremental:**
```
daily_change = replicable_TB × {{ change_rate }}%
monthly_transfer = daily_change × 30 × transfer_rate
monthly_compute = daily_change × 30 × 1024 × 0.2 credits/GB × ${{ credit_rate }}
```

**Monthly Storage:**
```
monthly_storage = replicable_TB × ${{ storage_rate }}/TB
```

